{
 "nodes": [
  {"id":"title","type":"text","x":-600,"y":-420,"width":1500,"height":90,"color":"5","text":"# Reel pipeline + screen control (built 2026-10-08)\nGreen/cyan = built and proven today. Grey = planned. Red = secret."},

  {"id":"g_you","type":"group","x":-600,"y":-300,"width":420,"height":520,"label":"You","color":"6"},
  {"id":"phone","type":"text","x":-580,"y":-250,"width":380,"height":120,"text":"**Phone / PC**\nSee a reel on Instagram, YouTube or TikTok, copy the link."},
  {"id":"tg","type":"text","x":-580,"y":-90,"width":380,"height":130,"text":"**Telegram**\nSend the link to your private bot `@yusha_reel_saver_bot` (name: Reel Saver)."},
  {"id":"botfather","type":"text","x":-580,"y":70,"width":380,"height":120,"text":"**@BotFather** (one time)\n`/newbot` made the bot and gave the token."},

  {"id":"g_pc","type":"group","x":-120,"y":-300,"width":1020,"height":520,"label":"This PC (no VPS, no n8n)","color":"5"},
  {"id":"bot","type":"text","x":-100,"y":-250,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"4","text":"**reel_bot.py** (`C:\\dev\\reels\\bot`)\nstdlib Python, runs via `start-bot.cmd` (pythonw, log `bot.log`).\nOwner pairing: `/start <6-digit code>` from `pair-code.txt`.\nLinks only from Instagram / YouTube / TikTok, or a video under 20 MB.\nSkips files already saved (\"Already saved\")."},
  {"id":"limits","type":"text","x":-100,"y":-20,"width":380,"height":190,"text":"**Politeness limits**\n30 s gap between Instagram downloads\n10 min pause on a 429\nStop on a login challenge\nNo proxies, no CAPTCHA tricks."},
  {"id":"ytdlp","type":"text","x":340,"y":-250,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"4","text":"**yt-dlp**\nDownloads the video + `.info.json` using the session cookies."},
  {"id":"cookies","type":"text","x":340,"y":-70,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"1","text":"**cookies.txt** (SECRET)\n`C:\\dev\\reels\\cookies.txt`\nValid to 2027-10-08. Never print, paste or commit."},
  {"id":"inbox","type":"text","x":660,"y":-250,"width":220,"height":150,"color":"4","text":"**1-inbox**\n`C:\\dev\\reels\\1-inbox`\nmp4 + info.json land here."},
  {"id":"token","type":"text","x":660,"y":-70,"width":220,"height":120,"color":"1","text":"**.telegram-token** (SECRET)\n46 chars, written from the clipboard, never shown."},

  {"id":"g_next","type":"group","x":-120,"y":260,"width":1020,"height":300,"label":"Planned (step 3)"},
  {"id":"analyse","type":"text","x":-100,"y":310,"width":300,"height":200,"text":"**Analyse**\nAudio, Whisper words with times, frames, cuts, timeline.\nEarlier run: `3-analysed\\yt_Y2gLUMjhiBs`."},
  {"id":"classify","type":"text","x":240,"y":310,"width":300,"height":200,"text":"**Classifier**\nWhat kind of reel, what it teaches.\nVision step for frames: local model or Claude in session (open question)."},
  {"id":"vault","type":"text","x":580,"y":310,"width":300,"height":200,"text":"**Vault inbox**\nNotes filed into Obsidian.\nDesign: reel-analysis-pipeline."},

  {"id":"g_ctrl","type":"group","x":-600,"y":260,"width":420,"height":520,"label":"Screen control (tested today)","color":"2"},
  {"id":"claude","type":"text","x":-580,"y":310,"width":380,"height":130,"text":"**Claude Code**\nIn VS Code. Acts only on your instruction."},
  {"id":"winmcp","type":"text","x":-580,"y":470,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"**Windows-MCP** (CursorTouch v0.8.5)\nProject scope, telemetry off. PowerShell / Registry / FileSystem / Scrape / Process / Clipboard tools excluded.\nTools used: Screenshot, Snapshot, App, Click, Type, Wait."},
  {"id":"lessons","type":"text","x":-580,"y":650,"width":380,"height":110,"text":"**Lessons**\nSwitch windows with `App mode=switch`; taskbar icons shift.\nCheck window position before typing."},

  {"id":"shots","type":"text","x":940,"y":-300,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"3","text":"**Screenshot clutter**\nEvery Screenshot/Snapshot saves a PNG copy: `~\\.claude\\projects\\...\\tool-results\\mcp-windows-mcp-blob-*.png`.\n18 files, 6.8 MB this session.\nFix: fewer screenshots (one per state change, none after a plain Wait) + delete blobs older than 1 day."},
  {"id":"cleanup","type":"text","x":940,"y":-10,"width":420,"height":200,"text":"**Cleanup script** (planned)\n`clean-screenshots.ps1` deletes blobs older than 1 day.\nDaily scheduled task was blocked by the permission classifier: needs your OK."}
 ],
 "edges": [
